#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`Neat` class usage {#neat-class-usage}"
msgstr "Penggunaan kelas `Neat` {#neat-class-usage}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before submitting a resource-intensive Qiskit Runtime workload to execute on"
" hardware, you can use the Qiskit Runtime [`Neat` (Noisy Estimator Analyzer "
"Tool)](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-tools-"
"neat#neat) class to verify that your Estimator workload is set up correctly,"
" is likely to return  accurate results, uses the most appropriate options "
"for the specified problem, and more.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebelum mengirimkan workload Qiskit Runtime yang intensif sumber daya untuk "
"dijalankan di hardware, kamu bisa menggunakan kelas Qiskit Runtime [`Neat` "
"(Noisy Estimator Analyzer Tool)](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-"
"ibm-runtime/debug-tools-neat#neat) untuk memverifikasi bahwa workload "
"Estimator kamu sudah dikonfigurasi dengan benar, kemungkinan akan "
"menghasilkan hasil yang akurat, menggunakan opsi yang paling tepat untuk "
"masalah yang ditentukan, dan lainnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`Neat` Cliffordizes the input circuits for efficient simulation, while retaining its structure and depth. Clifford circuits suffer similar levels of noise and are a good proxy for studying the original circuit of interest.\n"
"First, import the relevant packages and [authenticate to the Qiskit Runtime service](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr ""
"`Neat` melakukan Cliffordisasi terhadap sirkuit input untuk simulasi yang efisien, sambil mempertahankan struktur dan kedalamannya. Sirkuit Clifford mengalami tingkat noise yang serupa dan merupakan proksi yang baik untuk mempelajari sirkuit asli yang diminati.\n"
"Pertama, impor paket yang relevan dan [autentikasi ke layanan Qiskit Runtime](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare the environment {#prepare-the-environment}"
msgstr "Siapkan lingkungan {#prepare-the-environment}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Initialize a target circuit {#initialize-a-target-circuit}"
msgstr "Inisialisasi Circuit target {#initialize-a-target-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Consider a six-qubit circuit that has the following properties:\n"
msgstr ""
"Pertimbangkan sebuah sirkuit enam-Qubit yang memiliki properti berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Alternates between random `RZ` rotations and layers of `CNOT` gates.\n"
msgstr "Bergantian antara rotasi `RZ` acak dan lapisan gate `CNOT`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Has a mirror structure, that is, it applies a unitary `U` followed by its "
"inverse.\n"
msgstr ""
"Memiliki struktur cermin, yaitu menerapkan unitary `U` diikuti oleh "
"inversnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/debug-qiskit-"
"runtime-jobs/extracted-outputs/df19af55-897d-4b1f-baf8-fac2641ae87d-0.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/debug-qiskit-"
"runtime-jobs/extracted-outputs/df19af55-897d-4b1f-baf8-fac2641ae87d-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Choose single-Pauli `Z` operators as observables and use them to initialize "
"the primitive unified blocs (PUBs).\n"
msgstr ""
"Pilih operator `Z` Pauli tunggal sebagai observable dan gunakan untuk "
"menginisialisasi primitive unified blocs (PUBs).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Cliffordize the circuits {#cliffordize-the-circuits}"
msgstr "Cliffordisasi Circuit {#cliffordize-the-circuits}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The previously defined PUB circuits are not Clifford, which makes them "
"difficult to simulate classically. However, you can use the `Neat` "
"[`to_clifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-"
"tools-neat#to_clifford) method to map them to Clifford circuits for more "
"efficient simulation.  The "
"[`to_clifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-"
"tools-neat#to_clifford) method is a wrapper around the "
"[`ConvertISAToClifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/transpiler-passes-convert-isa-to-clifford) transpiler pass, which "
"can also be used independently. In particular, it replaces non-Clifford "
"single-qubit gates in the original circuit with Clifford single-qubit gates,"
" but it does not mutate the two-qubit gates, number of qubits, or circuit "
"depth.\n"
msgstr ""
"Circuit PUB yang telah didefinisikan sebelumnya bukan Clifford, yang "
"membuatnya sulit untuk disimulasikan secara klasik. Namun, kamu bisa "
"menggunakan metode `Neat` "
"[`to_clifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-"
"tools-neat#to_clifford) untuk memetakannya ke Circuit Clifford agar simulasi"
" lebih efisien. Metode "
"[`to_clifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-"
"tools-neat#to_clifford) adalah pembungkus dari transpiler pass "
"[`ConvertISAToClifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/transpiler-passes-convert-isa-to-clifford), yang juga bisa digunakan"
" secara independen. Khususnya, metode ini menggantikan gate single-Qubit "
"non-Clifford dalam Circuit asli dengan gate single-Qubit Clifford, tetapi "
"tidak mengubah gate dua-Qubit, jumlah qubit, atau kedalaman Circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See [Efficient simulation of stabilizer circuits with Qiskit Aer primitives](/guides/simulate-stabilizer-circuits) for more information about Clifford circuit simulation.\n"
"First, initialize `Neat`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lihat [Simulasi efisien dari Circuit stabilizer dengan Qiskit Aer primitives](/guides/simulate-stabilizer-circuits) untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang simulasi Circuit Clifford.\n"
"Pertama, inisialisasi `Neat`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next, Cliffordize the PUBs.\n"
msgstr "Selanjutnya, lakukan Cliffordisasi pada PUBs.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/debug-qiskit-"
"runtime-jobs/extracted-outputs/3ad78f41-a2f8-4381-826a-ae728e081ad6-0.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/debug-qiskit-"
"runtime-jobs/extracted-outputs/3ad78f41-a2f8-4381-826a-ae728e081ad6-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Application 1: Analyze the impact of noise on the circuit outputs "
"{#application-1-analyze-the-impact-of-noise-on-the-circuit-outputs}"
msgstr ""
"Aplikasi 1: Menganalisis dampak noise pada output Circuit "
"{#application-1-analyze-the-impact-of-noise-on-the-circuit-outputs}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This example shows how to use `Neat` to study the impact of different noise "
"models on PUBs as a function of circuit depth by running simulations in both"
" ideal ([`ideal_sim`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/debug-tools-neat#ideal_sim)) and noisy "
"([`noisy_sim`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-"
"tools-neat#noisy_sim)) conditions. This can be useful to set up expectations"
" on the quality of the experimental results before running a job on a QPU. "
"To learn more about noise models, see [Exact and noisy simulation with "
"Qiskit Aer primitives](/guides/simulate-with-qiskit-aer#exact-and-noisy-"
"simulation-with-qiskit-aer-primitives).\n"
msgstr ""
"Contoh ini menunjukkan cara menggunakan `Neat` untuk mempelajari dampak "
"berbagai model noise pada PUB sebagai fungsi kedalaman Circuit dengan "
"menjalankan simulasi dalam kondisi ideal "
"([`ideal_sim`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-"
"tools-neat#ideal_sim)) dan kondisi berisik "
"([`noisy_sim`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-"
"tools-neat#noisy_sim)). Ini berguna untuk menetapkan ekspektasi kualitas "
"hasil eksperimen sebelum menjalankan job pada QPU. Untuk mempelajari lebih "
"lanjut tentang model noise, lihat [Simulasi eksak dan berisik dengan Qiskit "
"Aer primitives](/guides/simulate-with-qiskit-aer#exact-and-noisy-simulation-"
"with-qiskit-aer-primitives).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The simulated results support mathematical operations, and can therefore be "
"compared with each other (or with experimental results) to calculate figures"
" of merit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hasil simulasi mendukung operasi matematis, sehingga dapat dibandingkan satu"
" sama lain (atau dengan hasil eksperimental) untuk menghitung tolok ukur "
"kualitas.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"A QPU can be affected by different kinds of noise. The Qiskit Aer noise model used here only simulates some of them and therefore is likely to be less severe than the noise on a real QPU.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"QPU bisa dipengaruhi oleh berbagai jenis noise. Model noise Qiskit Aer yang digunakan di sini hanya mensimulasikan sebagian dari noise tersebut, sehingga kemungkinan besar kurang parah dibandingkan noise pada QPU sungguhan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For details on what errors are included when initializing a noise model from a QPU, see the Aer [`NoiseModel`](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-aer/stubs/qiskit_aer.noise.NoiseModel.html#qiskit_aer.noise.NoiseModel.from_backend) API reference.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk detail tentang error apa saja yang disertakan saat menginisialisasi model noise dari QPU, lihat referensi API Aer [`NoiseModel`](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-aer/stubs/qiskit_aer.noise.NoiseModel.html#qiskit_aer.noise.NoiseModel.from_backend).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Begin by performing ideal and noisy classical simulations.\n"
msgstr "Mulailah dengan melakukan simulasi klasik yang ideal dan berisik.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, apply mathematical operations to compute the absolute difference. The "
"remainder of the guide uses the absolute difference as a figure of merit to "
"compare ideal results with noisy or experimental results, but similar "
"figures of merit can be set up.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selanjutnya, terapkan operasi matematis untuk menghitung selisih absolut. "
"Sisa panduan ini menggunakan selisih absolut sebagai tolok ukur untuk "
"membandingkan hasil ideal dengan hasil berisik atau eksperimental, tapi "
"tolok ukur serupa bisa juga dibuat.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The absolute difference shows that the impact of noise grows with the "
"circuits' sizes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selisih absolut menunjukkan bahwa dampak noise semakin besar seiring "
"bertambahnya ukuran Circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can follow these rough and simplified guidelines to improve circuits of "
"this type:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu bisa mengikuti panduan kasar dan sederhana ini untuk meningkatkan "
"Circuit jenis ini:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If the mean absolute difference is greater than 90%, mitigation will likely "
"not help.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika selisih absolut rata-rata lebih dari 90%, mitigasi kemungkinan tidak "
"akan membantu.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If the mean absolute difference is less than 90%, [Probabilistic Error "
"Amplification (PEA)](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-"
"techniques#probabilistic-error-amplification-pea) will likely be able to "
"improve the results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika selisih absolut rata-rata kurang dari 90%, [Probabilistic Error "
"Amplification (PEA)](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-"
"techniques#probabilistic-error-amplification-pea) kemungkinan akan dapat "
"meningkatkan hasilnya.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If the mean absolute difference is less than 80%, [ZNE with gate "
"folding](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#zero-noise-"
"extrapolation-zne) will also likely be able to improve the results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika selisih absolut rata-rata kurang dari 80%, [ZNE dengan gate "
"folding](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#zero-noise-"
"extrapolation-zne) juga kemungkinan dapat meningkatkan hasilnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Because all of the absolute differences above are less than 90%, applying PEA to the original circuit will hopefully improve the quality of its results.\n"
"You can specify different noise models in the analyzer. The following example performs the same test but adds a custom noise model.\n"
msgstr ""
"Karena semua selisih absolut di atas kurang dari 90%, menerapkan PEA pada Circuit asli diharapkan dapat meningkatkan kualitas hasilnya.\n"
"Kamu bisa menentukan model noise yang berbeda dalam analyzer. Contoh berikut melakukan pengujian yang sama tapi menambahkan model noise kustom.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As shown, given a noise model, you can try to quantify the impact of noise "
"on the (Cliffordized version of the) PUBs of interest before running them on"
" a QPU.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seperti terlihat, dengan menggunakan model noise tertentu, kamu dapat "
"mencoba mengukur dampak noise pada PUB (versi Cliffordized) yang ingin kamu "
"jalankan sebelum menjalankannya pada QPU.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Application 2: Benchmark different strategies {#application-2-benchmark-"
"different-strategies}"
msgstr ""
"Aplikasi 2: Membandingkan berbagai strategi {#application-2-benchmark-"
"different-strategies}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This example uses `Neat` to help identify the best options for your PUBs. To"
" do so, consider running an estimation problem with PEA, which cannot be "
"simulated with `qiskit_aer`. You can use `Neat` to help determine which "
"noise amplification factors will work best, then use those factors when "
"running the original experiment on a QPU.\n"
msgstr ""
"Contoh ini menggunakan `Neat` untuk membantu mengidentifikasi opsi terbaik "
"untuk PUB kamu. Untuk melakukan itu, pertimbangkan menjalankan masalah "
"estimasi dengan PEA, yang tidak bisa disimulasikan dengan `qiskit_aer`. Kamu"
" bisa menggunakan `Neat` untuk menentukan faktor amplifikasi noise mana yang"
" paling cocok, lalu gunakan faktor-faktor tersebut saat menjalankan "
"eksperimen asli pada QPU.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The result with the smallest difference suggests which options to choose.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hasil dengan selisih terkecil menunjukkan opsi mana yang sebaiknya "
"dipilih.\n"

